                                      "name": "Description",
                                      "fill": "#f3f4f6ff",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": 718,
                                      "content": "\"Slate\" is a versatile color often used in design systems. It's associated with tranquility, confidence, and stability, making it popular among finance, tech, fashion, and home decor brands. Paired with neutrals, it creates a modern aesthetic and can add contrast and depth to colorful designs. Overall, \"slate\" is a dynamic color that can bring both calmness and boldness to a design.",
