                                    },
                                    {
                                      "type": "text",
                                      "id": "NzaUS",
                                      "name": "Description",
                                      "fill": "#f3f4f6ff",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": 718,
                                      "content": "Stone, a warm gray tone, conveys stability and dependability. It's a great neutral color for typography in design systems, adding hierarchy and organization. In UI design, it can add sophistication to buttons and borders. Stone is versatile and can pair with other neutrals or bold colors, creating depth and contrast. It's popular in home decor and fashion, conveying understated luxury.",
