                                      "fill": "#f3f4f6ff",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": 718,
                                      "content": "Yellow is a vibrant color associated with happiness and optimism. In design, it draws attention and creates warmth and friendliness. Yellow is used in food and beverage branding, children's products, and educational materials. In UI design, it highlights important elements and stimulates mental activity. When paired with other colors, such as black or navy blue, it creates a modern aesthetic.",
