                                      "fill": "#f3f4f6ff",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": 718,
                                      "content": "Lime is a bright color associated with freshness and vibrancy. In design, it can draw attention and create a playful and exciting feel. Lime is used in health, sports, and outdoor brandings. In UI design, it highlights notifications or links and stimulates creativity. When combined with blue or gray, it can create a modern and dynamic look.",
