                                      "width": 718,
                                      "content": "Rose is a bold and energetic color associated with passion and excitement. In design, it demands attention and creates vibrancy, making it popular in branding for beauty, fashion, and entertainment industries. In UI design, it highlights important elements and creates urgency. When combined with other colors like white or black, rose can create a modern and edgy look.",
