                                      "name": "Description",
                                      "fill": "#6b7280ff",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": 718,
                                      "content": "Gray is a versatile color for design systems, commonly associated with neutrality, balance, and sophistication. It's often used by brands in technology, finance, and health industries to convey a professional image. In design, gray provides contrast and depth to colorful elements and can be paired with brighter colors to create a modern aesthetic. Overall, it's a reliable color that can convey different moods depending on how it's used.",
