                                      "fill": "#6b7280ff",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": 718,
                                      "content": "Zinc is a muted gray color used in modern and industrial aesthetics to convey durability, strength, and sophistication. Brands in the construction, manufacturing, and technology industries often use zinc to create a bold and contemporary look. Zinc can be paired with brighter colors and adds a touch of modernity and professionalism to any design.",
