                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": 718,
                                      "content": "Amber is a warm and energetic color that can add energy to a design system, associated with optimism and creativity. It's a great choice for brands in entertainment, education, and hospitality. In UI/UX design, amber is often used for call-to-action buttons and icons, and as an accent color to add depth and contrast to more neutral color palettes.",
