                                      "fill": "#6b7280ff",
                                      "textGrowth": "fixed-width",
                                      "width": 718,
                                      "content": "Purple is bold and imaginative, often associated with creativity and luxury in design. It adds elegance and sophistication and is commonly used in branding for beauty, fashion, and entertainment industries. In UI design, it can create contrast and highlight important information. When combined with white or gold, it can create a regal and opulent look.",
